WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.500
Hi Melina! Welcome to the Stellar Glass Accounting and Notary Hub.

00:08.500 --> 00:17.500
Once you accept the Accountant invite from Wesley Stel or Jason Vergara, just click Accounting in the top navigation bar.

00:17.500 --> 00:26.500
Right at the top, you'll see live contract receivables, ten percent retainage held by general contractors, customer deposits, and every item waiting on your notary seal or QuickBooks sync.

00:26.500 --> 00:36.500
In the Signed and Notarized Document Vault, you have direct access to every contract, change order, W-9, and general contractor package that Wesley Stel and Jason Vergara upload across all jobs.

00:36.500 --> 00:46.500
You can click Open on any file to review or download it right away.

00:46.500 --> 00:57.500
And once you've stamped and scanned a notarized pay application or lien waiver, just pick the job at the top of the vault and upload the PDF straight into the job's Contracts and documents folder.

00:57.500 --> 01:08.500
Next, let's look at the AIA G702 and G703 Notary Queue.

01:08.500 --> 01:20.000
Every progress pay application shows the current payment due, retainage, and any customer deposits offset against the draw.

01:20.000 --> 01:30.500
When you click Print G702, Stellar Glass automatically fills in your Hillsborough County, Florida Notary Certificate with your commission number HH 427582, and lists Wesley Stel or Jason Vergara as the authorized signer.

01:30.500 --> 01:40.500
Need a Florida statutory lien waiver or a vendor sworn statement for the general contractor?

01:40.500 --> 01:50.500
Right inside the same queue, you can generate a Partial Waiver upon Progress Payment, a Final Waiver, a Contractor Affidavit, or a Notice to Owner Sworn Statement for suppliers like Trulite Glass and Aluminum.

01:50.500 --> 02:00.000
Each form opens ready to print with the contract dates, payment amounts, Wesley Stel or Jason Vergara's signature line, and your Melina S. Arias Florida Notary block already filled out.

02:00.000 --> 02:10.000
Finally, the Accounting Software Sync Center connects Stellar Glass directly to your books.

02:10.000 --> 02:20.000
You can map your Chart of Accounts once at the bottom of the page, enter general contractor check numbers as payments clear, and check the Synced box as you reconcile each draw.

02:20.000 --> 02:28.500
Then, with a single click, export a balanced QuickBooks Online CSV, a QuickBooks Desktop IIF file, or a Xero ledger so you never have to re-type an invoice or retainage entry by hand.
